### Strict Mode
- No data leaves the device
- Local model only
- Maximum privacy

### Balanced Mode (Default)
- PII is detected and sanitized
- Simple completions handled locally
- Complex requests may use cloud

### Permissive Mode
- Full cloud features enabled
- Best completion quality
- Configurable data sharing

